.TH ferry-text 1  Ferry "Ferry Manual"
.SH NAME
ferry\-text \- Send text or a link; the receiver copies it to the clipboard after accepting
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBferry text\fR [\fB\-\-lang\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fB\-t\fR|\fB\-\-to\fR> [\fITEXT\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Send text or a link; the receiver copies it to the clipboard after accepting
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-lang\fR \fI<CODE>\fR
Interface language for this run (`en`, `pl`); overrides the saved setting
.TP
\fB\-t\fR, \fB\-\-to\fR \fI<TO>\fR
Alias, nearby device name, Node ID or TICKET of the receiver
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fITEXT\fR]
Text to send (default: read from standard input)
